Krita Nova 60 - Brush Panel: Mirror View button, 20% taller

Between the "more" (3 dots) button and the blending mode button, a Mirror
View on/off button: Krita's "mirror_canvas" action (its icon, shortcut M).
It is highlighted while the view is mirrored, and otherwise flat like the
panel's other buttons.

The panel starts 20% taller (0.79 of the window height instead of 0.66,
at least 384 px, never past the window). It is placed again once at the
new height (kritarc androidBrushPanelPlaced4 -> androidBrushPanelPlaced5).

diff --git a/libs/ui/KisMainWindow.cpp b/libs/ui/KisMainWindow.cpp
